  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7014109",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701410901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701410901": {
            "id": "701410901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, tell me about the ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410902"
            ]
          },
          "701410902": {
            "id": "701410902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Perhaps you've already noticed, but that slab of ice is surrounded by a great many blue plants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410903"
            ]
          },
          "701410903": {
            "id": "701410903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "I believe that those plants may be related in some way to the shard frozen in the ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410904"
            ]
          },
          "701410904": {
            "id": "701410904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "If you wish to continue looking for those shards on Dragonspine, I'd say that you might have some luck following the trail of those blue plants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410905"
            ]
          },
          "701410905": {
            "id": "701410905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "I believe that the <color=#00E1FFFF>Entombed City Outskirts</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>Starglow Cavern</color> are home to many of those blue plants. You can go and check them out. Perhaps you might discover something."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014110",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701411001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701411001": {
            "id": "701411001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, tell me about the ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411002"
            ]
          },
          "701411002": {
            "id": "701411002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Since we've got a way to melt that ice now, that means I can continue organizing expedition parties to explore the mountain..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014111",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701411101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701411101": {
            "id": "701411101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, tell me about the ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411102"
            ]
          },
          "701411102": {
            "id": "701411102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "If you'd just like to have a look at the ice, you can just go to the place that I mentioned. For you own safety, don't go any further into the mountain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014106",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701410601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701410601": {
            "id": "701410601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "This is a sticky situation, indeed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410602"
            ]
          },
          "701410602": {
            "id": "701410602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How are things here on Dragonspine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410603"
            ]
          },
          "701410603": {
            "id": "701410603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "On this mountain? Well, I can only say that it's more dangerous than any other place in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410604"
            ]
          },
          "701410604": {
            "id": "701410604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Apart from the harsh conditions, this mountain is also home to some strange... ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410605"
            ]
          },
          "701410605": {
            "id": "701410605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "This ice is incredibly hard to break, and will not melt when exposed to fire. It has proved a major obstacle to our exploration as a result.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410606"
            ]
          },
          "701410606": {
            "id": "701410606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Unfortunately, we have been unable to find a way to deal with that ice, so we've had to go around it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410607"
            ]
          },
          "701410607": {
            "id": "701410607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll have a look at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410608"
            ]
          },
          "701410608": {
            "id": "701410608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You're just going to have a look, right? If so, I remember that there was a large slab of ice of that kind on the mountain's outer boundaries. Who knows what's frozen inside it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410609"
            ]
          },
          "701410609": {
            "id": "701410609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You could have a look around there, but remember, it's best not to come this way again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014108",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701410801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701410801": {
            "id": "701410801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I found a shard under the platform.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410802"
            ]
          },
          "701410802": {
            "id": "701410802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Hydro Hypostasis fragment introduction..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014101",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701410101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701410101": {
            "id": "701410101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How are things here on Dragonspine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410102"
            ]
          },
          "701410102": {
            "id": "701410102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "On this mountain? Well, I can only say that it's more dangerous than any other place in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410103"
            ]
          },
          "701410103": {
            "id": "701410103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Apart from the harsh conditions, this mountain is also home to some strange... ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410104"
            ]
          },
          "701410104": {
            "id": "701410104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "It is incredibly hard to break, and will not melt when exposed to fire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410105"
            ]
          },
          "701410105": {
            "id": "701410105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Worst of all, a few roads have been blocked by this ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410106"
            ]
          },
          "701410106": {
            "id": "701410106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Quite a few of our expedition teams have been forced to turn back after being blocked by ice barricades that they could not get around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410107"
            ]
          },
          "701410107": {
            "id": "701410107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "*sigh* I wonder when we're going to find a way to get rid of that ice...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410108"
            ]
          },
          "701410108": {
            "id": "701410108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll have a look at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410109"
            ]
          },
          "701410109": {
            "id": "701410109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You're just going to have a look, right? If so, I remember that there was a large slab of ice of that kind on the mountain's outer boundaries. Who knows what's frozen inside it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410110"
            ]
          },
          "701410110": {
            "id": "701410110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You could have a look around there, but remember, it's best not to come this way again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014102",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate the strange ice",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701410201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701410201": {
            "id": "701410201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Tell me about those blue plants...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701410202"
            ]
          },
          "701410202": {
            "id": "701410202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "If you've a mind to, you can head to the area around the <color=#00E1FFFF>Snow-Covered Path</color>, the <color=#00E1FFFF>Entombed City Outskirts</color> and the <color=#00E1FFFF>Starglow Cavern</color> to have a look. I remember seeing many of those blue plants there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014125",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701419701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701419701": {
            "id": "701419701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eek! That thing just flew up into the air... Looked like it was going towards the mountain's summit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701419702"
            ]
          },
          "701419702": {
            "id": "701419702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Shall we go and have a look around? Or should we go back and ask someone about the situation?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014126",
      "subQuestName": "Continue upwards to investigate",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014130",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701419501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701419501": {
            "id": "701419501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "S—S—So cold... P—Paimon's turning into a Paimon popsicle!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701419502"
            ]
          },
          "701419502": {
            "id": "701419502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wh—What's... going on here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701419503"
            ]
          },
          "701419503": {
            "id": "701419503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "W—We should go back and ask around at the camp in the foothills..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7014127",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Iris",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701411201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701411201": {
            "id": "701411201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This mountain really is a dangerous place...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411202"
            ]
          },
          "701411202": {
            "id": "701411202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Oh? You're back. How did it go? Did you see the ice— Huh. You're in... quite a state, aren't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411203"
            ]
          },
          "701411203": {
            "id": "701411203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Do you know anything about the air current in the cavern?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411204"
            ]
          },
          "701411204": {
            "id": "701411204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You've already been that high up? That's very impressive. Still... a cavern blocked by a strange air current, you say? Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411205"
            ]
          },
          "701411205": {
            "id": "701411205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Ah, that reminds me. We did have an adventure team that also got lucky enough to reach a point very high up the mountain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411206"
            ]
          },
          "701411206": {
            "id": "701411206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "They couldn't get close enough, but they did report that a cavern near the summit had a strange and powerful air current flowing out from it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411207"
            ]
          },
          "701411207": {
            "id": "701411207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "But logically speaking, no air current in such a place should be that strong. No one knows the reason why, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411208"
            ]
          },
          "701411208": {
            "id": "701411208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Apart from that strange air current, this mountain is also home to some very strange ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411209"
            ]
          },
          "701411209": {
            "id": "701411209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "This ice is incredibly hard to break, and will not melt when exposed to fire. It has proved a major obstacle to our exploration as a result.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411210"
            ]
          },
          "701411210": {
            "id": "701411210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "We have been unable to find a way to deal with that ice, so we've had to go around it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411211"
            ]
          },
          "701411211": {
            "id": "701411211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "What's more, blue plants are often found growing near this ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411212"
            ]
          },
          "701411212": {
            "id": "701411212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "I could vaguely see that there was something encased within the ice. But since I was unable to melt it, catching a glimpse of it was as far as I got...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411213"
            ]
          },
          "701411213": {
            "id": "701411213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "If you're interested, you can follow the trail of blue plants to have a look at that ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411214"
            ]
          },
          "701411214": {
            "id": "701411214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Let me think... I believe that the <color=#00E1FFFF>Entombed City Outskirts</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>Starglow Cavern</color> are home to many of those blue plants. You can go and check them out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411215"
            ]
          },
          "701411215": {
            "id": "701411215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "A strange, powerful air current, bizarre ice, and odd plants...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411216"
            ]
          },
          "701411216": {
            "id": "701411216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Hahaha, if this was your standard tale of adventure, there would be some link between these three.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411217"
            ]
          },
          "701411217": {
            "id": "701411217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "But in real life, it's best to be practical when adventuring... Make sure you prepare yourself sufficiently before heading up Dragonspine, you hear?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
