    {
      "subId": "7014129",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the camp and ask for clues regarding the strange air current",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "701411301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "701411301": {
            "id": "701411301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How are things here on Dragonspine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411302"
            ]
          },
          "701411302": {
            "id": "701411302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "On this mountain? Well, I can only say that it's more dangerous than any other place in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411303"
            ]
          },
          "701411303": {
            "id": "701411303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Apart from the harsh conditions, this mountain is also home to some strange... ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411304"
            ]
          },
          "701411304": {
            "id": "701411304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "It is incredibly hard to break, and will not melt when exposed to fire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411305"
            ]
          },
          "701411305": {
            "id": "701411305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Worst of all, a few roads have been blocked by this ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411306"
            ]
          },
          "701411306": {
            "id": "701411306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Quite a few of our expedition teams have been forced to turn back after being blocked by ice barricades that they could not get around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411307"
            ]
          },
          "701411307": {
            "id": "701411307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "*sigh* I wonder when we're going to find a way to get rid of that ice...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411308"
            ]
          },
          "701411308": {
            "id": "701411308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about the strange ice...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411309"
            ]
          },
          "701411309": {
            "id": "701411309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "What? You encountered the strange ice... and you were able to melt it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411310"
            ]
          },
          "701411310": {
            "id": "701411310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "H—How can this be? How did you do it? Huh... There were strange crystals nearby?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411311"
            ]
          },
          "701411311": {
            "id": "701411311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You can use those to melt through the ice? I see, I see... Looks like I'll have to investigate this thoroughly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411312"
            ]
          },
          "701411312": {
            "id": "701411312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Well, let's put that aside first. Looking at you, I suppose you want to continue going deeper into the mountain, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411313"
            ]
          },
          "701411313": {
            "id": "701411313",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Do you know anything about the air current in the cavern?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411314"
            ]
          },
          "701411314": {
            "id": "701411314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "You've already been that high up? That's very impressive. Still... a cavern blocked by a strange air current, you say? Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411315"
            ]
          },
          "701411315": {
            "id": "701411315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "We did have an adventure team that also got lucky enough to reach a point very high up the mountain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411316"
            ]
          },
          "701411316": {
            "id": "701411316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "They couldn't get close enough, but they did report that a cavern nearby had a strange and powerful air current flowing out from it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411317"
            ]
          },
          "701411317": {
            "id": "701411317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "But logically speaking, no air current in such a place should be that strong. No one knows the reason why, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411318"
            ]
          },
          "701411318": {
            "id": "701411318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Apart from that strange air current, this mountain is also home to some very strange ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411319"
            ]
          },
          "701411319": {
            "id": "701411319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "This ice is incredibly hard to break, and will not melt when exposed to fire. It has proved a major obstacle to our exploration as a result.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411320"
            ]
          },
          "701411320": {
            "id": "701411320",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "We have been unable to find a way to deal with that ice, so we've had to go around it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411321"
            ]
          },
          "701411321": {
            "id": "701411321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "What's more, blue plants are often found growing near this ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411322"
            ]
          },
          "701411322": {
            "id": "701411322",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "I could vaguely see that there was something encased within the ice. But since I was unable to melt it, catching a glimpse of it was as far as I got...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411323"
            ]
          },
          "701411323": {
            "id": "701411323",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "If you're interested, you can follow the trail of blue plants to have a look at that ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411324"
            ]
          },
          "701411324": {
            "id": "701411324",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Let me think... I believe that the <color=#00E1FFFF>Snow-Covered Path</color>, the <color=#00E1FFFF>Entombed City Outskirts</color> and <color=#00E1FFFF>Starglow Cavern</color> are home to many of those blue plants. You can go and check them out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411325"
            ]
          },
          "701411325": {
            "id": "701411325",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "A strange, powerful air current, bizarre ice, and odd plants...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411326"
            ]
          },
          "701411326": {
            "id": "701411326",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "Hahaha, if this was your standard tale of adventure, there would be some link between these three.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "701411327"
            ]
          },
          "701411327": {
            "id": "701411327",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iris",
            "text": "But in real life, it's best to be practical when adventuring... Make sure you prepare yourself sufficiently before heading up Dragonspine, you hear?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
